        "May is exam month for the IB Diploma everywhere in India, with results out in early July and a smaller November window for retakes. Cambridge IGCSE sits in May-June and again in October-November; Edexcel IGCSE runs in January and May-June. Durga Puja here is genuinely bigger than in most Indian cities, built around silver-adorned pandals that draw crowds for days, and Bali Jatra in November adds a further week where ordinary routines simply stop.",
